  "5531": {
    "class_type": "MarkdownNote",
    "inputs": {
      "widget_0": "## Decode\n\nMake sure to adjust the number of tiles and overlap to fit your hardware.\n(fewer tiles will result in faster execution, but will require more memory).\n\n### Recommended settings\n\n| node settings (pixels)                     | resolved latent geometry        |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| `512 / 64 / 128 / 32`                      | 16\u00d716, ov 2 | 16f, ov 4         |\n| `768 / 192 / 128 / 32`                     | 24\u00d724, ov 6 | 16f, ov 4         |\n| `1024 / 256 / 128 / 48`                    | 32\u00d732, ov 8 | 16f, ov 6         |\n| `1536 / 384 / 192 / 48`                    | 48\u00d748, ov 12 | 24f, ov 6        |\n| `768 / 192 / spatial-only`                 | 24\u00d724, ov 6 | no temporal split |"
    },
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Decode"
    }
  },
